00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:28.629
We train with our handguns on our dominant
side and our Taser on our weak side.

00:02:28.629 --> 00:02:32.569
So if you're right handed, you carry your
firearm on your right side and you carry a

00:02:32.569 --> 00:02:35.970
Taser on the left.

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:41.319
This is done purposefully and it's trained
as I watch the video and listen to the officer's

00:02:41.319 --> 00:02:46.010
